{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7675291819555490075","title":"中国区-整车物流运输专员","description":"1. 协助工厂VDC到交付中心的一次物流运营管理，跟踪运输各项指标并参与改善；\n2. 协助根据交付计划制定运输计划及运营策略，支撑交付目标达成；\n3. 参与整车运输标准、SOP、培训体系的迭代与优化，保障运输运营质量和效率；\n4. 协助供应商日常培训的组织与跟进，保障项目顺利推进；\n5. 参与整车运输系统的需求整理与迭代优化，支持项目高效运转；\n6. 支持各交付中心运输业务的开城输入与员工培训，确保顺利开城。","requirement":"1. 本科及以上学历，物流管理、供应链管理、交通运输等相关专业优先；\n2. 对整车物流/运输行业有兴趣，了解基本的物流运营流程；\n3. 具备较强的学习能力和创新思维，关注用户价值；\n4. 良好的沟通协调能力，能适应跨部门协作；\n5. 熟练使用Excel、PPT等办公工具，有数据分析能力者优先；\n6. 有车企/物流相关实习经验者优先；","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1787043338312,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7467761246948507756","name":"交付类","en_name":"Delivery","i18n_name":"交付类"},"job_id":"7675291819555359003","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_